<title>UK: TENNIS-MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS AT WIMBLEDON.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS AT WIMBLEDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mixed doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding)</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Karsten Braasch (Germany)/Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat 12-Jim</p>
<p>Grabb (U.S.)/Debbie Graham (U.S.) 4-6 7-5 15-13</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France)/Laura Golarsa (Italy) beat Byron</p>
<p>Talbot (South Africa)/Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
</text>
